# Balmond, Bloody Beast

> Balmond is a low-maintenance fighter who wins when the game rewards staying in the middle of the fight longer than the enemy expected. Pick him for wave control, objective cleanup, and second-entry damage. Do not pick him when the enemy can repeatedly stop Cyclone Sweep or kite Soul Lock before the fight starts.

